msgid ""
"Check links through the Internet. If you click on the button above, the "
"database will be scanned, and the server will attempt to open each link "
"through the network. Broken URLS will be reported to you for further "
"troubleshoting. Note that the program will stop automatically if too many "
"broken links are found."
